{"unit_id":"woodfood111__dsh-subscription-login#card-zh","repo":"woodfood111/dsh-subscription-login","commit":"a5c19a6291f4c67ba4fb9ca205e43e5f6b59a2d6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subscription-login 是一个 DSH 网页插件，在设置的插件订阅页汇总当前部署注册的模型登录流程。它通过 DSH 授权和凭据服务列出可用登录方式，并提供登录、流程问答、状态查看、取消、登出和无主凭据清理。适合希望在一个页面管理多个模型提供方授权的 DSH 用户；需组合提供授权流程的 pi-ai 适配器及 DSH 宿主服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25","lib/registry.js:148","lib/registry.js:224","lib/registry.js:430","lib/client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"woodfood111__dsh-subscription-login#card-en","repo":"woodfood111/dsh-subscription-login","commit":"a5c19a6291f4c67ba4fb9ca205e43e5f6b59a2d6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subscription-login is a DSH web plugin that lists registered provider sign-ins in Settings. It guides login and prompts, shows credential status, cancels attempts, signs out, and lists unclaimed records for cleanup. It needs host services and an adapter that registers sign-in flows.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25","lib/registry.js:148","lib/registry.js:224","lib/registry.js:430","lib/client.js:1"]}
